{"product_id":"the-cheerleaders-of-doom-nerds-book-three","title":"The Cheerleaders of Doom (NERDS Book Three)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Cheerleaders of Doom is the third book in New York Times bestselling author Michael Buckley’s NERDS series.Matilda “Wheezer” Choi is an asthmatic who can fly and kick butt courtesy of her nanobyte-enhanced inhalers. She loves pro wrestling and hates anything “girlie.” Unfortunately for Wheezer, when a former-NERD-turned-villain gets extensive plastic surgery in order to become a cheerleader, Matilda must swallow her pride to successfully infiltrate the squad. The villain with pom-poms, Gerdie Baker, has created a device that opens portals to other worlds, and if Matilda doesn’t find a way to destroy it, the fates of all the worlds will be at stake.The NERDS series combines the excitement of international espionage with the awkwardness of elementary school as it follows the adventures of a group of unpopular fifth graders who run a spy network from inside their school. With the help of cutting-edge science, they transform their nerdy qualities into incredible abilities, and the results are awesome, inspiring, and hilarious.“Fans of the series will gladly recognize how the mayhem of the plot is well matched by a surfeit of quips and general goofiness of the highest order.” —BooklistNERDS series:National Espionage, Rescue, and Defense Society (#1)M is for Mama’s Boy (#2)The Cheerleaders of Doom (#3)The Villain Virus (#4)Attack of the BULLIES (#5)\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Buckley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781419704147\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803735646361,"sku":"16RA-3-9781419704147","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d5081ecd0fb_The_Cheerleaders_of_Doom__NERDS_Book_Three__Michael_Buckley.jpg?v=1760808702","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-cheerleaders-of-doom-nerds-book-three","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}